      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Circuitborn (Synapse Line)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“Where attention goes, you can follow.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Noosphere Hook (tier [TODO(pb-call)]/a Soma Break).</strong> As an action, you lock onto a creature, location, or faction you have observed. For 10 minutes, you know the general direction to it and gain reroll the lowest die on checks to track it (including digital/social tracking) [TODO(adv-call)].</p>",
